l,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[41,44,67,64,83,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP28016","armor":"WP1015102","helmet":"WP1014102","horse":"WP1001515"},"couple":["WJ10528"]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1010","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[41,44,67,64,83,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP28016","armor":"WP1015102","helmet":"WP1014102","horse":"WP1001515"},"couple":["WJ10528"]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1033","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[41,44,67,64,83,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP28016","armor":"WP1015102","helmet":"WP1014102","horse":"WP1001515"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1032","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[41,44,67,64,83,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"99","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP28016","armor":"WP1015102","helmet":"WP1014102","horse":"WP1001515"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10042","city":"CS1033","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[41,44,67,64,83,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP28016","armor":"WP1015102","helmet":"WP1014102","horse":"WP1001515"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"马超庶妻，马秋之母，雍州扶风郡茂陵人。建安十九年，马超入蜀投奔刘备时，将董伶与儿子马秋留于汉中依附张鲁。建安二十年，曹操攻占汉中，张鲁投降，董伶被曹操赐给阎圃，马秋则被张鲁亲手杀死。亲眼目睹爱子惨死，自身又被当作战利品赐人，却因身处乱世、无依无靠，董伶只能被迫从命，自此归入阎圃府中。","tc":"馬超庶妻，馬秋之母，雍州扶風郡茂陵人。建安十九年，馬超入蜀投奔劉備時，將董伶與兒子馬秋留于漢中依附張魯。建安二十年，曹操攻占漢中，張魯投降，董伶被曹操賜給閻圃，馬秋則被張魯親手殺死。親眼目睹愛子慘死，自身又被當作戰利品賜人，卻因身處亂世、無依無靠，董伶只能被迫從命，自此歸入閻圃府中。","en":"A secondary wife of Ma Chao and the mother of Ma Qiu, hailing from Maoling in Fufeng Commandery, Yong Province. In 214, when Ma Chao entered Shu to join Liu Bei, he left Dong Ling and their son Ma Qiu in Hanzhong under Zhang Lu. In 215, when Cao Cao captured Hanzhong and Zhang Lu surrendered, Dong Ling was bestowed by Cao Cao upon Yan Pu, while Ma Qiu was personally killed by Zhang Lu. Having witnessed the tragic death of her beloved son with her own eyes, and then being handed over to another as a war trophy, Dong Ling, helpless in a turbulent age, had no choice but to comply, thereafter entering Yan Pu's household.","jp":"馬超の側室であり、馬秋の母。雍州扶風郡茂陵県の人。建安十九年、馬超が蜀に入り劉備を頼った際、董伶と息子の馬秋は漢中に残され、張魯のもとに身を寄せた。建安二十年、曹操が漢中を攻略して張魯が降伏すると、董伶は曹操によって閻圃へ下賜され、馬秋は張魯の手で殺害された。愛子の惨死を目の当たりにし、自身も戦利品として他人に与えられることとなったが、乱世において身寄りもなかった董伶はやむなく命に従い、これ以降、閻圃の府に入ることとなった。","kr":"마초의 첩이자 마추의 어머니로, 옹주 부풍군 무릉 사람입니다. 건안 19년, 마초가 촉으로 들어가 유비에게 몸을 의탁할 때 동령과 아들 마추를 한중에 남겨 장로에게 의탁하게 했습니다. 건안 20년, 조조가 한중을 함락하고 장로가 항복하자, 동령은 조조에 의해 염포에게 하사되었고 마추는 장로의 손에 살해당했습니다. 사랑하는 아들의 참혹한 죽음을 두 눈으로 목격하고 자신마저 전리품 신세로 남에게 하사되었으나, 난세에 의지할 곳 없던 동령은 어쩔 수 없이 명에 따를 수밖에 없었으며, 이후 염포의 가문으로 들어가게 되었습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1025615","remark":"","surname":"董","surnameTc":"董","surnameEn":"Dong","surnameJp":"董","surnameKr":"동","surnameOther":"","name":"伶","nameTc":"伶","nameEn":"Ling","nameJp":"伶","nameKr":"령","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"董伶","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"188","city":"CS1032","gender":"1","rule":"41","force":"44","wise":"67","politics":"64","charm":"83","will":"70","ruleTalent":"6","forceTalent":"6","wiseTalent":"6","politicsTalent":"7","charmTalent":"13","willTale